from email:

A change in the version strings (specifically the last commit, dirty state, etc) won't trigger a rebuild.  Linker flags aren't tracked.  You'll see this most of the time when doing e2e tests.

Perhaps we should write linker flags to a file and verify them before deciding not to incrementally build.

